      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just hard to find that anchor when the whole world feels built for people who aren't me. it's like i'm a person from a different century trying to live in a place that doesn't have any room for my kind of quiet. everything is so much noise and light and constant updates... i feel like i'm just taking up space that doesn't belong to me anymore.",
